INCONCLUSIVE — the catalog half did not run. A foreign key's ON DELETE action lives only in pg_constraint.confdeltype; nothing static can see it, so all 2288 declared foreign keys are UNVERIFIED.
  Set REFERENTIAL_ACTION_GATE_DATABASE_URL to a database bootstrapped to journal head to run it.
  Or set STREAMLINE_ALLOW_PARTIAL_GATES=1 to accept a declaration-only run.
